        "mission_intent": "Team, we need to conduct a comprehensive review of our current collection posture against the Southeastern Mediterranean target set to identify where we have single-source dependencies. Specifically, I want the collection managers to map our existing coverage across GEOINT, HUMINT, IMINT, MASINT, and OSINT and flag any priority intelligence requirements where we're relying on fewer than two complementary INT disciplines. For each identified gap, provide a recommended multi-INT collection strategy that leverages at least one additional discipline, ensuring all proposed methods are lawful and consistent with existing oversight requirements. The assessment should evaluate whether the intelligence products currently being generated from these single-source streams meet the standards for relevance and timeliness that our consumers expect. Please coordinate with our liaison partners where appropriate and ensure any proposed HUMINT or covert collection enhancements are routed through the appropriate legal review channels. I'd like the initial gap assessment briefed to leadership by the end of next week, with a full collection strategy recommendation to follow within ten business days after that. Make sure the final product addresses feasibility constraints including platform availability and budget considerations for the next fiscal quarter.",
